This package is the Python version of metacheck, the R package by Lisa
DeBruine, Cristian Mesquida, Jakub Werner, Daniel Lakens and contributors
(https://github.com/scienceverse/metacheck). It is a port of that package: its
checks, texts, regular expressions, reference data and outputs come from the R
package and are compared with it by the parity tests in this repository. The R
package is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, and so is
